{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124483","id":4862335669,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIdFatQ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124483","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124483.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124483.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124483","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124483/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124483/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124483/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/4c506532b8afce727b6d518f97a860cd425321da","number":124483,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Update physics query objects docs to reflect intended usage.","user":{"login":"StarryWorm","id":41305715,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxMzA1NzE1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41305715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm","html_url":"https://github.com/StarryWorm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StarryWorm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Follow-up to #113970 \r\n- Docs-based alternative/complement to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123663\r\n\r\nIn the PR above, non-allocating query methods were introduced to the `PhysicsDirectSpaceState2D`/`3D` classes that write results directly into typed result objects. These methods are intended to be used for high-demand applications, a fact that is not currently reflected in the docs. \r\nThis PR adds a note to the result Objects that were introduced in that PR, as well as the parameters Objects, detailing their intended use scenario.\r\nThis mirrors [existing documentation for the `NavigationPathQueryObjects`](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/navigation/navigation_using_navigationpathqueryobjects.html#creating-a-basic-path-query) which explicitely states \"While not a strict requirement, both objects are intended to be created once in advance, stored in a persistent variable for the agent and reused for every followup path query with updated parameters.\" in order to guide users towards performant usage. Unlike those objects, which are highly customizable and thus need a full tutorial page dedicated to their usage, the physics result objects only need a simple note in their class description. ","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518839,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg4Mzk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/documentation","name":"documentation","description":"","color":"ffddff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milest